          <summary>How does online appointment booking work with Bookwize?</summary>
          <p>Clients visit your branded Bookwize booking page, choose a service and staff member, select an available date and time, and confirm their appointment. You receive an instant notification and the client gets an email confirmation with a calendar invite. No app download or account creation is required for clients.</p>
