        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Does Bookwize send appointment reminders to reduce no-shows?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Bookwize automatically sends email confirmations when a booking is made and reminders 24 hours before the appointment. This significantly reduces no-shows and keeps your schedule full. SMS reminders are available on paid plans.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
