          <p>Yes. Bookwize is based in Montreal, Quebec, Canada. The platform supports Canadian dollars (CAD), Eastern Time and all Canadian timezones, and is fully bilingual (French and English). It's designed specifically for Canadian service businesses including salons, barbershops, spas, and wellness practitioners.</p>
